  "ingredients": [
    "3.75 cups all-purpose flour",
    "1 teaspoon baking powder",
    "0.5 teaspoon salt",
    "1.5 cups white sugar",
    "1 cup margarine, softened",
    "2 eggs",
    "2 teaspoons vanilla extract"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YV0cFuFc6ncI5EfkEX2L3sxlBmI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-01-bcd6dc1a953f458db28635481fe4afa6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sift flour, baking powder, and salt together in a medium bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rMEb6g7mOZXh3Zl1yZ8M7SVX0Jc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-02-5235ffe47f454c029b685b60584759ae.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat sugar and butter in a large bowl with an electric mixer until smooth.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/iklfAm8DMzPEKR1_brZlzucUz0s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-03-3aac05344a1245b290779e132d571c3a.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Beat first egg into butter mixture. Beat second egg into mixture along with vanilla extract; add flour mixture and stir until dough is just combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/Qk7oLhKp03MfzaTaHWXs075y0ks=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-04-B-f963361b27394f5faebd24fa595cb970.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Wrap dough and chill in the refrigerator for 2 hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/r_tg7iKu60AQHlXxbqn7xn3Nt8U=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-05-f4fc2e9b227849e89abb01fb1d5166b2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 400 degrees F (200 degrees C). Grease two cookie sheets.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/UfE56PAT7XR5GKeXrxszoAmApfk=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-06-0a8d0b5976fb448b989c3afea20a2728.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Roll out dough on a clean floured surface to 1/4-inch thickness. Cut out shapes using Christmas cookie cutters; arrange them on the prepared cookie sheets. Gather scraps and repeat this step.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/YBKCCURBwBqxOse4h3hZLM7dlb4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-07-fadac5de629540b392363a32764ba557.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake in batches in the preheated oven until edges are golden, about 6 to 8 minutes. Cool on the baking sheet briefly before removing to a wire rack to cool completely before frosting or decorating.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/WGiCa0IszaX-m-Jem5Hv5s9NaoY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-step-08-f57e7867cf9644b1a92b39c0c8d0bdb2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve and enjoy!",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/QYgcRLFqa5ntvlFYx6CD4ndPYCs=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/ALR-recipe-10110-soft-christmas-cookies-01-4x3-c75844ae9722478cb58056e30593dbbd.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/10110/step_09.webp"
    }
